 "provenance_note": "Registry-native cohort: AACT search returned 1165 SGLT2-inhibitor drug records; 18 trials posted a HF/CV-composite hazard ratio; 18 had a usable HR + 95% CI (most-precise per trial, fail-closed on implausible HR or degenerate CI). AACT-results-posted cohort, NOT a dual-screened systematic review; the HR is the published time-to-event estimate. Synthesis hierarchy: single-endpoint Bayesian HF league (sglt2_league.json), canagliflozin lead; ertugliflozin k=1 -> INSUFFICIENT. This is a HF/surrogate-composite ranking, not a mortality claim."
}